---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="The story behind Lost Hiker Coffee Roasters — Jordan and Leah, roasting in Sayward, BC.">

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">Our Story</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Built by wanderers.</h1>
      <p class="page-intro">Lost Hiker is a home roastery in Sayward, BC. It's run by Jordan and Leah — two people who love mountains, good coffee, and the quiet satisfaction of doing something well.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container story-grid">
      <div class="story-image sticky-image">
        <img src="/images/leahjordan.jpg" alt="Leah and Jordan, co-founders of Lost Hiker Coffee Roasters" />
      </div>
      <div class="story-text">
        <h2>How it started</h2>
        <p>Jordan has been roasting coffee at home for years — the kind of hobby that starts with one piece of equipment and slowly takes over a corner of the kitchen. When Leah joined in, it became something different: less experiment, more practice. They got serious about sourcing, serious about technique, and serious about what they were actually making.</p>

        <p>The name came naturally. They live at the end of the Kusam Climb trail — a route most people treat as a day hike and a few treat as a life's work. The trailhead is practically their front door. "Lost hiker" isn't a warning; it's a disposition. It's the person who takes the unmarked fork, stays out past dark, and finds something good they weren't looking for.</p>

        <h2>The roastery</h2>
        <p>Everything is roasted in small batches at their home in Sayward. Small-batch roasting means more attention per batch — adjusting temperatures by feel and sound as much as by dial, stopping at exactly the right moment. It's slower than roasting at scale, but that's the point.</p>

        <p>Sayward is a small community on the northeast coast of Vancouver Island, surrounded by old-growth forest and inlet water. It's quiet and it's beautiful and it makes sense as a place to do something careful and unhurried. The mountains are right there.</p>

        <h2>What we care about</h2>
        <p>We buy green beans from importers whose sourcing we respect — people who work directly with farms and care about traceability and fair pay. Right now, most of our coffee comes from Colombia's Huila region, through Mastercol. We like knowing exactly where it's from and who grew it.</p>

        <p>We're not trying to be everything. Five roasts, each one developed over time, each one named for something that matters to us. We think that's plenty.</p>

        <blockquote>
          <p>"Not all who wander are lost — but some of us are, and we're doing fine."</p>
        </blockquote>

        <p>If you have questions about our coffee or want to place an order, <a href="/contact">get in touch</a>. We're not hard to find.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="values-strip">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="values-grid">
        <div class="value">
          <div class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌖</div>
          <h3>Small batch</h3>
          <p>Every roast is done in small quantities to maintain quality and consistency. We'd rather roast more often than compromise a batch.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value">
          <div class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">◈</div>
          <h3>Traceable sourcing</h3>
          <p>We buy through importers who work directly with farms. We know the region, the farm, and often the variety and process.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value">
          <div class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">◇</div>
          <h3>Roasted to order</h3>
          <p>Coffee is better fresh. We roast when orders come in rather than sitting on inventory. Your bag is as fresh as it gets.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 5rem 0 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .page-intro {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--mid);
    max-width: 680px;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .story-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 380px 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .sticky-image {
    position: sticky;
    top: 90px;
  }

  .story-image img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 2px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .story-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .story-text h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .story-text h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
    border-top: none;
  }

  .story-text p {
    color: var(--mid);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .story-text a {
    color: var(--green);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  blockquote {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--green);
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    background-color: var(--surface);
    border-radius: 0 2px 2px 0;
  }

  blockquote p {
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.1rem !important;
    color: var(--cream) !important;
  }

  /* Values strip */
  .values-strip {
    background-color: var(--surface);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 4rem 0;
    margin-top: 4rem;
  }

  .values-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .value {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .value-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--green);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .value h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .value p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--mid);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .story-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }

    .sticky-image {
      position: static;
    }

    .story-image img {
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    }

    .values-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .values-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
